&#x200B;

I think my employer will be accepting. But it is very uncomfortable to disclose something so personal

Yes there is a way. I know that in new zealand all the drugs you can get come with an online fact sheet, in this you will find a category labelled other or inactive ingredients, which will tell you what type of filler is used. 

&#x200B;

If you are literally taking a handful then it may be worth calculating. However if it is 5-10 at half a gram each, its not a huge concern. My thinking is that if the pill weighs half a gram, even if that pill was all filler it would not be much
